      "name": "volkswagner",
      "created_at": "2025-09-27T00:47:58.126Z",
      "cooked": "<p>When creating a new <code>Transaction Deletion Record</code> all fields are read-only.</p>\n<p>How can we perform a selective Transaction Deletion if we can’t edit the form?</p>\n<p>I can’t check any check boxes or remove/add any items in the doctype list (while logged in as system administrator).</p>\n<p>More specifically, how can I exclude <code>Sales Tax Templates</code> from being deleted?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/2/82b272efd69c09d42bb1662bbda26ce49d0c99d0.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/82b272efd69c09d42bb1662bbda26ce49d0c99d0\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-09-26 at 8.44.42 PM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/2/82b272efd69c09d42bb1662bbda26ce49d0c99d0_2_644x500.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-09-26 at 8.44.42 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"iEcozrEQT7bKOqrYH5WhurMJVny\" width=\"644\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/2/82b272efd69c09d42bb1662bbda26ce49d0c99d0_2_644x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/2/82b272efd69c09d42bb1662bbda26ce49d0c99d0_2_966x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/2/82b272efd69c09d42bb1662bbda26ce49d0c99d0_2_1288x1000.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FCFCFC\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-09-26 at 8.44.42 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">1317×1021 54.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
