      "id": 482294,
      "username": "DaizyModi",
      "name": "Daizy Modi",
      "created_at": "2025-09-27T04:32:14.060Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/volkswagner\">@volkswagner</a> ,</p>\n<p><strong>Sales Taxes and Charges Template</strong> is already part of the <strong>Excluded Doctypes</strong> when you perform <em>Delete Transactions</em> from Company.</p>\n<p>If you want to exclude any other doctypes from being deleted, you can use the following in your custom app’s <code>hooks.py</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">company_data_to_be_ignored = [\"Salary Structure\", \"Leave Period\"]\n</code></pre>\n<p>Replace the doctypes in the list with the ones you want to preserve. This way, system will automatically ignore them during the transaction deletion process.</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/daizymodi/{size}/57544_2.png",
      "trust_level": 2,
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
